  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The tendency to seek out, interpret and remember evidence in ways that favour a belief or hypothesis one already holds, usually without being aware of doing so, while giving less weight to evidence that could count against it." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/scheme/cognitive-biases> .
