  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/analysis-of-competing-hypotheses> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/belief-perseverance> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/biased-assimilation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/consider-the-opposite> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/confirmation-bias> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/falsifiability> .
