  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-the-antecedent/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How likely is the consequent when the antecedent is absent, and has anyone checked?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-the-antecedent/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/denying-the-antecedent> .
