  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-major/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/illicit-major/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the conclusion's predicate about all members of its class while the premise spoke only of some of them?" .
