  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/burden-of-proof> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The obligation, carried by one side of a dispute, to support a claim with enough evidence or argument to meet the applicable standard; if the burden is not met, the claim is not accepted, though its opposite is not thereby proven." .
