  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/christiaan-huygens> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Dutch mathematician, physicist and astronomer (1629-1695) whose Treatise on Light (written 1678, published 1690) gave an early explicit statement of the hypothetico-deductive method, holding that principles are verified by the agreement of their consequences with observation, and whose 1657 tract on games of chance introduced mathematical expectation." .
