  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/informal-fallacy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/cognitive-bias> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/informal-fallacy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/false-dilemma> .
