  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/map/o2> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#claimText> "Her lateness may justify asking her to explain herself or to follow the rule too, not dropping the rule." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/map/o2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.arg.dundee.ac.uk/aif#I-node> .
