  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "How often would this same evidence show up if the outcome were absent (the false-positive rate)?" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/base-rate-neglect> .
